    "Although we wished you could have stayed with us much longer — celebrating your 75th birthday and even living to 120 years — we are grateful to God for the years He gave you and for the legacy you leave behind. We take comfort in knowing that you are in the right place, resting peacefully in the presence of the Lord.",
